# Onboard parameters for Vehicle 1
#
# JUNE-15 RESTORE — RUNG 2 of 3: nominal June gain
#
# Apply ON TOP of RUNG 1. Restores RO_YAW_RATE_P to its literal 2026-06-15
# value.
#
# ⚠ This does NOT restore June's LOOP gain. In June the plant over-delivered
#   ~12% (RD_MAX_THR_YAW_R = 0.95, plant G = 1.12), so the effective gain was
#   0.17 x 1.12 = 0.190. Today RD_MAX_THR_YAW_R = 1.14 and G = 1.00, so 0.17
#   gives 0.170 — about 10% short of June. Rung 3 closes that.
#
# Measure BEFORE going to rung 3. Overshoot is the failure mode from here on:
# you are raising gain into a plant that is now correctly scaled.
#
# Vehicle-Id Component-Id Name Value Type
1	1	RO_YAW_RATE_LIM	30	9
1	1	RO_YAW_ACCEL_LIM	25	9
1	1	RO_YAW_DECEL_LIM	34	9
1	1	RO_YAW_RATE_P	0.17	9
